l elections  have made e-governance and  digitalization a  central point of their campaign goals  the pandemic response has highlighted  many of germany's shortcomings in areas  such as  digitalization and bureaucracy  things that will have to be dealt with  by the next generation of policy makers  if the country hopes to regain its  reputation of being a  world leader in efficiency  you
 

